<div class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-303003 lalaquan.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/fc/Spine_static-303003_lalaquan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"204\" height=\"421\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"204\" data-file-height=\"421\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3030\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8B%89%E6%8B%89%E6%B3%89\" title=\"拉拉泉\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8B%89%E6%8B%89%E6%B3%89\" title=\"拉拉泉\"><img alt=\"拉拉泉\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303001.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-303001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303001.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8B%89%E6%8B%89%E6%B3%89\" title=\"拉拉泉\">拉拉泉</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.4</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>线与数之间</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：303002</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">每个人都听过泉水精灵的故事，知道泉水中住着一位淘气的精灵，知道向她投下钱币可以许下愿望。<br />他们不知道，泉水精灵并不喜欢硬币，也不喜欢替人们实现愿望。<br />而在某座迷宫中，人们投下硬币只是为了计算它被泉水精灵发现的概率。<br />那里像一座巨大的城堡，到处是数字与符号。它们时而层层相叠，时而无限循环，与墙壁一起构成了难以理解的谜题。那里就像一座充满未知的游乐场，乐于隐藏它深奥的数学本质，而用精巧的阶梯和穹顶让人沉湎其中。<br />泉水精灵并不理解这些，但淘气的她有时会来到这里，漫不经心地拿起硬币，并摆出算式——尤其是在前来泉水投币的游人们吵得她不胜其烦时。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"303002\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303004.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3c/Belonging-303004.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">小圆帽<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Beret</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />2<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一顶由羊毛和亚麻制作的小帽子，能有效拢起头发。<br />据说帽子的作用是增加佩戴者的高度，以此增加威严和气场，不过这顶帽子带来了学者的气息，当然，还有一丝俏皮。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303005.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/33/Belonging-303005.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">香月桂头环<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Laurel Tiara</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>由新鲜月桂枝所编就的头环，花苞点缀其间，散发的香气清甜。桂冠常代表胜利与荣誉，也能让佩戴者的思绪保持清朗。最重要的是，绿色与她的头发很相配。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303006.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e2/Belonging-303006.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">红绘陶罐<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Terracotta Jar</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>在溪边的浅滩上所发现的陶罐，由赤泥烧制而成，表面的几何绘画展现了不俗的审美。因为意外的轻盈，让使用者的手腕轻松不少。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8C%E5%BE%8B%E8%83%8C%E5%8F%8D1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 二律背反1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8C%E5%BE%8B%E8%83%8C%E5%8F%8D1.jpg/229px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8C%E5%BE%8B%E8%83%8C%E5%8F%8D1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"229\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8C%E5%BE%8B%E8%83%8C%E5%8F%8D1.jpg/344px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8C%E5%BE%8B%E8%83%8C%E5%8F%8D1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8C%E5%